# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Juno Satellite IDs — one Satellite per app (see CLAUDE.md / plan §3).
#
# Local development:
#   1. `pnpm emulator`            → boots the Juno emulator (Console at
#                                    http://localhost:5866). See docs/juno-emulator.md.
#   2. In the local Console, create a Satellite per app and copy its dev ID
#      into the matching *_DEV var below (or reuse one Satellite while testing
#      a single app at a time).
#   3. Deploy locally with e.g.
#      `pnpm --filter portal-hub build && pnpm --filter portal-hub exec juno deploy`
#
# Production: launch each Satellite in the live Console (juno.build) and set the
# *_PROD vars (locally for manual deploys, or as GitHub repo Variables for CI).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Portal Hub
JUNO_SATELLITE_DEV=
JUNO_SATELLITE_PROD=

# Arraial Digital (TIC)
JUNO_ARRAIAL_DIGITAL_SATELLITE_DEV=
JUNO_ARRAIAL_DIGITAL_SATELLITE_PROD=

# Arraial da Matemática
JUNO_ARRAIAL_MATEMATICA_SATELLITE_DEV=
JUNO_ARRAIAL_MATEMATICA_SATELLITE_PROD=

# Caracóis da Matemática
JUNO_CARACOIS_MATEMATICA_SATELLITE_DEV=
JUNO_CARACOIS_MATEMATICA_SATELLITE_PROD=

# GitHub Actions: repo Secret JUNO_TOKEN (access key from Satellite → Setup →
# Add an access key); repo Variables hold the per-app *_PROD Satellite IDs.
